.TH "YAMLR-RULES" "1" "March 2026" "Yamlr Manual" "User Commands"
\fBRule Catalog Dashboard\fR
.PP
Displays a comprehensive table of all active semantic rules, checkers, and healers available in the current version.
.PP
.SH "USAGE"
.nf
.RS
yamlr rules [FLAGS]
.RE
.fi
.SH "FLAGS"
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fB-v, --verbose\fR: Show full rationale for every rule in an extra column.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fB--output=json\fR: Export rule database as structured JSON.
.SH "COLUMNS"
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **ID**: The unique Rule ID (e.g., \fBrules/no-latest-tag\fR).
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **Name**: Human-readable name.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **Severity**: ERROR, WARNING, or INFO.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **Description**: Brief summary of what the rule detects.
.SH "EXAMPLES"
.nf
.RS
yamlr rules
# Lists all 50+ active rules
.RE
.fi
